OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused complained about   
OL,4,Aneighbour, court told                  
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering his         
OL,7,Fneighbour made repeated complaints     
OL,8,Fabout him to the local council and     
OL,9,Fpolice, a court has heard.             
OL,11,FNigel Booth, 67, died at his flat in   
OL,12,FStamford, Lincolnshire, after he was   
OL,13,Fattacked by Andrew Greengrass, 37, who 
OL,14,Flived downstairs.                      
OL,16,FA murder trial at Lincoln Crown Court  
OL,17,Fheard that Booth received more than 20 
OL,18,Fwounds from a knife, including some    
OL,19,Fthat penetrated his heart.             
