OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused complained about   
OL,4,Aneighbour, court told                  
OL,6,FGreengrass, of Foundry Road, Stamford, 
OL,7,Fhas admitted killing his neighbour     
OL,8,Fduring the early hours of 21 October   
OL,9,Flast year, but denies murder claiming  
OL,10,Fhe lost control.                       
